    <briefdescription>
<para>Gate-4 benchmark for FILTER ST_Within(...) on a 100K-point corpus. </para>
    </briefdescription>
    <detaileddescription>
<para>Measures p99 query latency for two paths:<itemizedlist>
<listitem><para>Geo index prefilter (R-tree intersects on query bbox)</para>
</listitem><listitem><para>Sequential baseline (full scan point-in-bbox test)</para>
</listitem></itemizedlist>
</para>
<para>Gate target:<itemizedlist>
<listitem><para>GATE-GEO-01: p99 &lt;= 50 ms on geo-index path for 100K points. </para>
</listitem></itemizedlist>
</para>
